and second-year student,

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:44.840
Shinozuka Momo!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:47.380
As the disciplinary monitor, 
I shall give you a warning!

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:50.470
You two should stop hanging 
out with each other!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.850
Um... Isn't that...

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.640
...the girl who's always 
around Gotou-sensei?

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:02.350
It was rude of me, but I have been 
following you for some time now.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.850
You beat your friend with a whip...

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:06.650
Then you didn't stop her 
from climbing a wall...

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:09.230
Lastly, you both fought over water.

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:14.110
You two are a horrible 
influence on one another!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:19.500
Listen well. True friends lift 
each other up, seek righteousness,

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.540
and punish evil-doers!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:28.150
Only those you can face hardships with,

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:30.350
who will have your back in 
life or death situations—

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.380
Um...

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:34.130
You probably don't have any 
friends, do you, Senpai?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:35.550
There it is...

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.350
H-How did you know?!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.350
Activity Report

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:42.310
Only people who don't have friends 
talk about ideal friends.

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:46.190
We've been like this ever 
since we were in grade school.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.940
Not to mention...

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.490
The reason I decided to go to Samejima...

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:53.950
is because Chio-chan also 
applied for Samejima!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.030
What? I didn't know that!

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:59.240
Then, right here, right now,

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.250
prove your friendship to me in 
a manner that I will understand!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:09.210
Activity Report

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:03.880
If you cannot,

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:06.680
I will report all the dangerous 
activities I witnessed

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.770
to the student council!

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:13.470
We just need to make you see 
that we're friends, right?

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:17.260
We can't have you treat our 
ten years together so lightly...

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:21.330
...can we?

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.340
<i>Prove our friendship?</i>

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:25.520
<i>How?</i>

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:27.880
<i>Do we say each other's birthdays?</i>

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:30.690
<i>No, even acquaintances can do that...</i>

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:33.090
<i>The color of her panties? 
The name of the person she likes?</i>

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:36.150
<i>Wait. Those all sound easy, but...</i>

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:36.990
Manana...

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:37.950
Huh?

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.380
Let's do that one thing.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.240
That one thing?

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:47.580
That one thing?! No way! We'll die!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.000
What choice do we have?

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:55.780
Watch, Senpai.

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.180
For gym class in grade school...

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:01.310
...we took the theme of 
friendship and created...

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.730
...this dance.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:07.840
It's called...

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.190
...Mananacchio!

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:15.240
Meow!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:19.740
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, 
meow, meow, meow, meow, meow.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.160
Meowy, meowy, meowy 
meow meow meow meow.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:27.110
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, 
meow, meow, meow, meow, meow.

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:30.790
Meowy, meowy, meowy 
meow meow meow meow.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:39.300
Meow...

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:43.800
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, 
meow, meow, meow, meow, meow.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:49.600
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, 
meow, meow, meow, meow, meow.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.060
I'm Manyanya...

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:55.580
I'm Chionya, and we're...

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.530
...Mananacchio!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.110
Um...

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:06.700
That's it...

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.280
I'm so moved!

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:10.580
She's bawling?!

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:15.180
I could... clearly see... the friendship...

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.910
you worked so hard... to build...

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:24.390
As promised, I won't report any of this.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:26.920
Well, uh, thanks...

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:28.880
It's been so long since we did that.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.340
I barely remembered it.

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:33.020
Um, may I ask one last thing?

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.970
Um... Well...

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:41.570
How do you get closer to 
someone who's important to you?

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:47.030
Are you talking about Gotou-sensei?

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:47.930
Huh?!

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.540
I'm sure it is.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:54.280
But... Relationships between students 
and teachers are greatly frowned upon...

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:56.170
Did she basically just admit it?

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:57.590
Senpai.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:19:59.110
Y-Yes?

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.180
Even if there is an issue with 
that kind of relationship,

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.730
all the blame will fall on the teacher!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:05.230
Huh?

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:08.020
So you just need to pursue 
him as hard as you can!

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:10.360
As hard as you can, okay?

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:11.060
<i>Manana's totally invested now.</i>

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:12.410
It'll totally work out!

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:15.640
You really... think so?

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:16.650
Yes!

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:21.030
Um... Would it be okay if I talked 
to you about it sometimes?

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.070
Sure!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.240
Listen, you need to keep 
your rivals in check! Yes!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.160
In check!

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:28.710
And, Senpai, it's important 
for girls to be mysterious.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.400
I see!

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:33.770
Girls? Mysterious? How so?

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:38.090
This concludes my report.

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:40.730
No incidents... huh?

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:45.000
But make sure you don't 
act on your own too much.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:45.970
Yes, sir.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:49.080
By the way, your face doesn't 
seem as tense as usual.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:49.740
Huh?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:54.100
Did something good happen 
while you were patrolling?

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:57.400
U-Um, well...

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.640
At times like these, I'm supposed to say...

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:02.560
It's a secret.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:08.970
<i>Chio's School Road</i>.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.040
<b>Chio's</b>

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.040
School Road

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:12.670
Good morning.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.500
Gotou-chan...

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.760
Hear me out.

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:18.430
First, you need to greet me properly.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.360
<i>Nonomura-san also mentioned...</i>

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.300
Keep your rivals in check!

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:26.570
U-Um...

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:29.600
If you're going to talk to the advisor of 
the disciplinary committee, Gotou-sensei,

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.640
you need to look more proper...

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.850
Oh?

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:38.920
So that's what's going on...

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:42.380
But... are you sure that's okay?

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.450
If I became more prim and proper...

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:47.040
I might be even more destructive, you know?

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:49.690
I think our personalities 
will end up overlapping.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:28.390 --> 00:23:30.720
Next time on <i>Chio's School Road</i>,

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:34.930
"Everyone's Own Path" and "Chio-chan Eludes."

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:35.630
Look forward to—

00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:39.940
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, 
meow, meow, meow, meow, meow...
